    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35c7e3ea05e4ce9a368f184a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "他人诧异的目光于我已如无物。\r\n我不顾一切地大叫着，冲到亮相圈之下，\r\n向她宣告着我的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "325e8ba88358fdfe2350230e7f58009189ef79410f5b5d39ab24bd39027413fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
