      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们亦需坚如磐石。\r\n我们两人——已做好了化身流星的觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3453a416f044fa207cf1e411280141c0b3df355aa3be4d5ccf150eedd91f6044",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
