      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就无法对新宇宙的状态进行最后检查。\r\n如果发生了什么事，令她无法发挥全力的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd6e049759f9713ca5984f74b427bfe37de3e7ce123eeeaec5450fb29b14627c",
