      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "将我们二人隔绝开的海洋——此刻改变了形状，\r\n横在我们面前……",
      "source_fingerprint": "48477424b97ad6e6a4c933597b3c4b9a25753a6d96d2b6da59e975544f93feee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
