      "uid": "zhcn:ac462926681591701bb91017",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——『日本杯』。\r\n虽然新宇宙早在『宝冢纪念』已挑战过一次古\r\n马级的选手，但……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b781c0539f5912eb80a63ea107f9550eb802255017422a5626e61550e846a192",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
