      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙吗……\r\n真是久违了。\r\n这次——由我先下一城了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fdf94fbe28594ff5b9ae9b57ef528cfe3190e0d32201a4ae528b2cc57c58147",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
