    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:409cee2315fc50cba6684f74",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的发言如信号不好那般断断续续，\r\n嘟囔的还正好是最为重要的，\r\n关于“GATE”之后的情报……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9995fda899dff7744d298d1d2c438c0ab7997b1f371bcd80d183933399a8f23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105205.json",
      "json_path": [
