    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4876b332e454fa84740d4c1a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙的思考自遥远的彼方回到眼前的比赛中。\r\n无论她想表达什么——\r\n都先等我们闯过眼下这一关再说吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c854cdde090c1bf3d7beb06d0fdc8248fe85afefcebbfad92e77fda52f93b23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
