    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a8f3e10f070c5d0173c1ce6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次，没想到会与那一日曾交战过的对手再战。\r\n若能够进行一场爽快的对决自然是再好不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "97cbb0f90efb6be2dcdae6f46030c1c1561cfcf94b01b3fe8a23db573f2da9cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105205.json",
      "json_path": [
