      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93fef3a0db6fb760e53041ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不幸中的万幸是，新宇宙并非不擅长这湿透的\r\n赛道——\r\n不如说完全相反，她是个重马场的好手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "078392c586ba7c6abbc615a4731bbcab23dc338316fe451d51e736d2d986c3f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
